poster.avif?t=1749244273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204910/extras/a6029ffeb9c084c00c33a43a797c8445.webm?t=1749244273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204910/extras/a6029ffeb9c084c00c33a43a797c8445.mp4?t=1749244273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Destructibility, gibbing, and a bit of physics.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SCIENCE-FICTION SHOOTER PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a result of a failed portal experiment, the cyclopean installation &quot;D-SPEAR&quot; is broken, and humanity once again finds itself on the brink of extinction. The Gates of Hell are open again, and demons are rushing into our world. Only one person stands between Hell and Earth, and that person is you. Somewhere on the other side of the hellish portal, your wife awaits salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are about to embark on a long, terrifying, and mystery-filled journey. Amid fountains of blood and spent cartridges, knee-deep in gore, brushing shoulders with death at every turn. Feeding off the power of demons, traverse alternate dimensions, unraveling all the secrets of the teleportation complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But is Evil truly on the other side of the gates?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204910/extras/89c8d05c730d315851d40e701ebbf2eb.poster.avif?t=1749244273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204910/extras/89c8d05c730d315851d40e701ebbf2eb.webm?t=1749244273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204910/extras/89c8d05c730d315851d40e701ebbf2eb.mp4?t=1749244273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
